    "answer": {
      "short": "All its angles are $60^{\\circ}$, which is less than $90^{\\circ}$, so it is acute.",
      "worked": "Every angle in an equilateral triangle is $60^{\\circ}$. An acute triangle has all its angles less than $90^{\\circ}$. Since $60^{\\circ}<90^{\\circ}$, every equilateral triangle is acute.",
